PN,36401
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785489515
OL,3,CMum becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FA mum with advanced ovarian cancer has
OL,7,Fbecome the first patient in the world
OL,8,Fto receive a pioneering new therapy.
OL,10,FTracy Tomlinson was given the drug at
OL,11,Fthe Christie NHS Foundation Trust in
OL,12,FManchester as part of a clinical trial
OL,13,Fevaluating a new type of treatment for
OL,14,Fseveral types of cancer.
OL,16,FThe therapy, known as ZI-MA4-1, will
OL,17,Fbe tested on people with ovarian
OL,18,Fcancer, lung cancer, sarcomas and head
OL,19,Fand neck cancer in a trial led by the
OL,20,FChristie, with a site also at the
OL,21,FRoyal Marsden in London.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785489515
OL,3,CMum becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FMany people in the study have few
OL,7,Fother options for survival.
OL,9,FTracey, 58, from Chadderton, Greater
OL,10,FManchester, has already beaten the
OL,11,Fodds in staying alive, having
OL,12,Fundergone surgery and several rounds
OL,13,Fof chemotherapy since she was
OL,14,Fdiagnosed in 2020.
OL,16,FThe new therapy works by combining two
OL,17,Fpowerful methods in fighting cancer
OL,18,Fand it's hoped it will go on to become
OL,19,Fan "off-the-shelf" treatment.
OL,26,@{D@DOU{D@RO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785489515
OL,3,CMum becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FFirstly, it harnesses the body's
OL,7,Fnatural killer (NK) cells, which are
OL,8,Fspecialist immune cells that destroy
OL,9,Fabnormal ones.
OL,11,FSecondly, T-cell receptors (TCRs) on
OL,12,Fthe cells are engineered to recognise
OL,13,Fand target tumours producing a protein
OL,14,Fcalled Mage-A4.
OL,16,FMage-A4 is found in several types of
OL,17,Fcancer and experts believe it is an
OL,18,Fideal target for attacking abnormal
OL,19,Fcells.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785489515
OL,3,CMum becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FUnlike some personalised treatments,
OL,7,FZI-MA4-1 is designed as an "off-the-
OL,8,Fshelf" therapy that uses immune cells
OL,9,Ffrom donors.
OL,11,FThe treatment is manufactured in
OL,12,Fadvance from donor cells rather than
OL,13,Fbeing individually tailored to each
OL,14,Fpatient, with hundreds of doses
OL,15,Fproduced from a single manufacturing
OL,16,Fbatch.
OL,18,FExperts believe this could mean
OL,19,Fadvanced cell therapies are available
OL,20,Fto more patients more quickly, and at
OL,21,Fa cheaper cost.
OL,26,@oD@\OUpD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785489515
OL,3,CMum becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FMrs Tomlinson was diagnosed with
OL,7,Fovarian cancer that had spread shortly
OL,8,Fbefore Christmas 2020 and immediately
OL,9,Funderwent treatment.
OL,11,FBy summer 2021, scans showed no
OL,12,Fevidence of disease but, a year later,
OL,13,Fthe cancer returned.
OL,15,FDespite further rounds of treatment
OL,16,Fand 48 chemotherapy infusions, her
OL,17,Fcancer kept coming back.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785489515
OL,3,CMum becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FThe former Civil Service manager was
OL,7,Fdiagnosed as stage 3C, which means
OL,8,Fthere were cancer growths spreading
OL,9,Finto the peritoneum of the body.
OL,11,FShe currently has a tumour between the
OL,12,Fliver and kidney as well as small
OL,13,Ftumours elsewhere.
OL,15,FShe said: "They've got rid of the
OL,16,Fcancer twice but then it came back
OL,17,Fabout two and a half years ago, and
OL,18,Fwe've never seemed to get rid of it
OL,19,Fsince then.
OL,26,@wD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785489515
OL,3,CMum becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,F"The chemotherapy has shrunk it but
OL,7,Fwhen treatment stops, it has come
OL,8,Fback. It is a lot to live with and
OL,9,Fthere's been ups and downs ` there's
OL,10,Fbeen elation, there's been
OL,11,Fdisappointment, and bits in between.
OL,13,F"But I try very, very hard to remain
OL,14,Fvery positive. Every day that I wake
OL,15,Fup is a positive. You've got to have
OL,16,Fhope."
OL,18,FMrs Tomlinson said husband Paul, who
OL,19,Fshe married in 2022, is her "rock" and
OL,20,Fshe is also close to her son Harry, 28.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUxD@FO]{D@]OU{D@bO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785489515
OL,3,CMum becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FIn 2025, she was referred to the
OL,7,FChristie's early phase clinical trials
OL,8,Fteam for extensive screening, and
OL,9,Flearned she was a suitable candidate
OL,10,Ffor the Zima-101 clinical trial.
OL,12,F"I decided almost straight away that I
OL,13,Fwas going to go for it," she said.
OL,14,F"Then afterwards you think, 'Am I
OL,15,Fdoing the right thing?', because it is
OL,16,Fa little bit scary being the first
OL,17,Fperson in the world to have the
OL,18,Ftreatment."
OL,26,@tD@AOUuD@XO]vD@AOUzD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785489515
OL,3,CMum becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FShe has had three infusions of the
OL,7,Ftherapy, with the option of another
OL,8,Fone depending on what scans show.
OL,10,F"If it benefits me, absolutely
OL,11,Ffantastic," she said. "But if it
OL,12,Fbenefits other people in the future,
OL,13,Fthat's important too.
OL,15,F"I don't want to have gone through
OL,16,Feverything I've gone through for
OL,17,Fnothing. I want to feel like I have
OL,18,Fmade a difference."
OL,26,@rD@AOUsD@KO]sD@WOUwD@AOUzD@SO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785489515
OL,3,CMum becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FProfessor Fiona Thistlethwaite,
OL,7,Fconsultant medical oncologist at the
OL,8,FChristie, said: "While this is an
OL,9,Fearly-stage study primarily focused on
OL,10,Fsafety, it represents an exciting step
OL,11,Fforward in efforts to develop new
OL,12,Ftreatment options for people like
OL,13,FTracy with advanced solid tumours.
OL,15,F"We hope the knowledge gained will
OL,16,Fhelp shape future cancer treatments
OL,17,Fand ultimately improve outcomes for
OL,18,Fpatients."
OL,26,@pD@QOUwD@AOUzD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785489515
OL,3,CMum becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FDr Jon Lim, consultant medical
OL,7,Foncologist in advanced immunotherapy
OL,8,Fand cell therapy at the Christie,
OL,9,Fsaid: "What's very exciting about this
OL,10,Fis that these are essentially not kind
OL,11,Fof antibody-based, but living cells.
OL,13,F"These are live immune cells that are
OL,14,Finfused in hundreds of millions back
OL,15,Fto the patient, and the idea of this
OL,16,Fis that it is a little bit more
OL,17,Ftargeted.
OL,26,@qD@GOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785489515
OL,3,CMum becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,F"The reason this is very interesting
OL,7,Fis because this is the first of its
OL,8,Fkind globally in this approach, where
OL,9,Fit's taking donor immune cells,
OL,10,Fmanipulating or engineering them, and
OL,11,Fputting them into the recipient.
OL,13,F"Tracy is essentially getting somebody
OL,14,Felse's immune cells that have been
OL,15,Fengineered to 'see' her cancer. "We're
OL,16,Fvery excited.
OL,18,F"This is a novel approach in the cell
OL,19,Ftherapy space. We are also really
OL,20,Fshowcasing what we can do in the UK."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUwD@aOU|D@eO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36413
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785489515
OL,3,CMum becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FNamir Hassan, chief executive of
OL,7,FNorwegian firm Zelluna, which makes ZI-
OL,8,FMA4-1, said Tracey's first dose is a
OL,9,F"landmark moment".
OL,11,F"It represents the moment when years
OL,12,Fof research moved beyond the
OL,13,Flaboratory and into the clinic,
OL,14,Foffering a new potential treatment
OL,15,Foption for patients facing advanced
OL,16,Fcancers with limited alternatives."
OL,18,FOnly around 15% of women survive
OL,19,Fovarian cancer for five years or more
OL,20,Fafter they are diagnosed.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@QO]sD@AOUxD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/14
